<title>USA: IBM sets stock split, dividend.</title>
<headline>IBM sets stock split, dividend.</headline>
<dateline>ARMONK, N.Y. 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>International Business Machines Corp. said Tuesday it would split its stock 2-for-1 and declared a regular quarterly cash dividend of 35 cents a share before the split.</p>
<p>The world's largest computer maker said its board had approved the stock split subject to shareholders approving an increase in the number of authorized common shares.</p>
